        {
          "id": "5",
          "type": "true_false",
          "statement": "Gelmek istiyorum means “I want you to come.”",
          "answer": false,
          "explanation": "That’s “I want to come” — yourself. For someone else you need the form with a person: gelmeni istiyorum."
